    rdfs:comment "An ornate hand-carved wooden music box with intricate floral filigree relief on every face, brass hinges and a small brass crank, a lid inlaid with a mother-of-pearl rose, three-quarter view from the front and slightly above, the whole object visible with its depth clear, studio product photo on a plain light grey background, soft even lighting, extremely detailed" .

